#. Tag: para
#: news.docbook:11
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The news kioslave is used when you click on a news link on a web page. It "
"will open &knode;, and if the group referred to in the news link is "
"available from your server, it will subscribe you to the group, in the first "
"available account you have configured in &knode;"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: news.docbook:16
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"You can unsubscribe from within &knode; if you decide you don't want to read "
"the group, by <mousebutton>right</mousebutton> clicking and selecting "
"<guimenuitem>Unsubscribe from Group</guimenuitem>."
msgstr ""

